OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy and
OL,6,Fdry for most of the night, although
OL,7,Foutbreaks of rain may affect some
OL,8,Fplaces by the morning. A light
OL,9,Fnortheasterly breeze. Feeling cool.
OL,10,
OL,11,CFriday:FA generally cloudy day with
OL,12,Foutbreaks of rain possible throughout
OL,13,Fmost of the day, these will likely
OL,14,Fremain light. Temperatures remain near
OL,15,Faverage with a light breeze.
