OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FHigh
OL,6,Fpressure continues to dominate, cloud
OL,7,Fcover likely to break up allowing
OL,8,Fovernight mist and fog to develop,
OL,9,Fwhich will slowly clear during the
OL,10,Fmornings. Feeling cool with below-
OL,11,Faverage temperatures.
